/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 231 0 R
/E (Coulibistrie is a coastal community in Dominica that can be affected by storms, heavy rainfall, and flooding. Flooding does not affect every place the same way. Some roads may flood quickly, while other areas may be safer because they are higher up or farther from water. The project asked an important question: How can maps help a community understand flood risk before a disaster happens?)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6]
>>
