<<
/Title (Scientists and residents used maps to better understand flood risk in Coulibistrie. Researchers used drone pictures to see buildings, roads, rivers, and coastlines from above. Residents then marked important places on maps, such as homes, bridges, safe areas, and places that had flooded before. This helped combine scientific tools with local knowledge, since people who live in the community often know what maps alone might miss.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 17 0 R
/Next 499 0 R
>>
